---
name: Check Point to OCSF
description: |
  Maps parsed Check Point records from the `checkpoint` topic to OCSF and
  publishes them to the `ocsf` topic.
---

subscribe "checkpoint"
this = {source: this, ocsf: {}}
checkpoint::ocsf::map source, ocsf
this = ocsf
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
publish "ocsf"
